@alife-records 1

node vp_1338.VQ_HOUSE_BATH
  t.any.1 Please.. will ask before using up your washing water
  t.any.2 Could use a wash.. boots stay outside the clean bit
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_HOUSE_BED
  t.any.1 Yes.. tell me when you need it back
  t.any.2 Would like to lie down.. that's a yes without a speech
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_HOUSE_CHAIR
  t.any.1 All right.. somewhere I can see the way out would suit
  t.any.2 Could sit.. don't need the best one
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_HOUSE_LOCKS
  t.any.1 Would rather check for myself if you're offering
  t.any.2 Let me see what secures the door.. saying safe doesn't settle me
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_HOUSE_RADIO
  t.any.1 Try it.. still want somebody on air to say something plain
  t.any.2 Yes.. might be instructions instead of more guessing
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_NOW_HELP
  t.any.1 Can mend a roof if you've materials.. paint too, though that's less urgent
  t.any.2 Good with a brush and shingles.. don't volunteer me for electrical work
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_NOW_HUNGRY
  gate.rule need:hunger>=2
  t.any.1 Could eat.. wasn't wanting to make that your problem
  t.any.2 Yes.. appetite's decided to speak for itself
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_NOW_HUNGRY.d
  t.any.1 Not after food at the moment.. rest matters more
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1338.VQ_NOW_HURT
  t.any.1 Ask me where before poking.. can check anything that worries you
  t.any.2 Roofing left old aches.. would rather check than guess about a new one
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_NOW_PLAN
  t.any.1 Stop before I make a stupid choice from tiredness.. then look for May
  t.any.2 Need a direction that isn't simply away.. haven't chosen it yet
  t.any.3 Need to make my own next choice. Advice isn't forbidden; orders are
  t.any.4 Haven't picked. I can admit that without handing the choice over
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_NOW_THIRSTY
  gate.rule need:thirst>=2
  t.any.1 Yes.. need a drink, however proud I sound
  t.any.2 Throat's dry.. water would do
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_NOW_THIRSTY.d
  t.any.1 Enough to drink for now.. don't pour more on my account
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1338.VQ_NOW_TIRED
  t.any.1 Last sleep? Couldn't give you an hour.. tired enough to envy a folded towel
  t.any.2 Can't put a time to it.. could lie down if that's allowed
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_NOW_TRUST
  t.any.1 Enough to stay talking.. don't start giving me orders
  t.any.2 Getting there.. still dislike being dependent, whoever's offering
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_NOW_WANT
  gate.rule trust>=30 & flag:trainees_told
  t.any.1 Want a bed.. say I need nothing because asking shames me.. owner took my rented room back before all this, so there isn't a room waiting for me
  fx.1 reveal f_need
  fx.2 set flag:need_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_NOW_WANT.d
  t.any.1 Want a say in how I'm helped.. haven't decided how to ask
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1338.VQ_NOW_WANT.d2
  t.any.1 Want to be able to ask without feeling small.. not there yet
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1338.VQ_NOW_WASH
  t.any.1 Would like to clean up.. grit gets everywhere in roofing clothes
  t.any.2 Yes.. point me toward washing water before I help myself
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_OFFER_CARDS
  t.any.1 Cards will do.. prefer dominoes but won't refuse a game
  t.any.2 Yes.. no betting anything either of us needs
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_OFFER_DRINK
  t.any.1 I'll take you up on that.. thanks
  t.any.2 Yes please.. no need for a special fuss
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_OFFER_FOOD
  t.any.1 Could take a little if there's enough
  t.any.2 Yes.. let me choose my share rather than piling it up
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_OFFER_WORK
  t.any.1 Tell me the job before naming what it's worth
  t.any.2 Can trade work.. not promising an entire roof for one supper
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_PAST_BOSS
  gate.rule trust>=15
  t.any.1 Foreman paid late and wanted us early.. made crew leader in ninety.. left two grown trainees to collect my pay.. Dale fell off their unsecured ladder and broke an ankle.. I was supposed to be watching them
  fx.1 reveal f_trainees
  fx.2 set flag:trainees_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_PAST_BOSS.d
  t.any.1 Foreman could put pay off for weeks.. not ready to discuss the rest
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1338.VQ_PAST_CHILDHOOD
  t.any.1 Always helping paint.. Dad said paint side out before he said good morning
  t.any.2 Had lake reunions every summer.. stayed on the bank and ate enough for two swimmers
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_PAST_DAYONE
  t.any.1 Was in the truck when people started leaving.. spent too long wondering where they knew to go
  t.any.2 Heard frightened talk, put my boots on properly and kept moving.. no clever plan
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_PAST_FAMILY
  t.any.1 Dad Amos and Aunt May.. both last known near Cave City
  t.any.2 Trying to hear about May.. Dad and me weren't speaking when this started
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_PAST_FIRSTJOB
  t.any.1 Paid painting with Dad after school ended in eighty
  t.any.2 First proper wages were for house painting.. Dad deducted the brush I ruined
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_PAST_HOBBY
  t.any.1 Dominoes.. double six trouble when May gets it twice running
  t.any.2 Quilted with May's circle.. mostly went for the dominoes afterward
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_PAST_REGRET
  gate.rule trust>=75 & alone & flag:report_told
  t.any.1 Promised May the memorial quilt would stay with our circle.. sold it in ninety-two for my truck repair.. blamed a mistake by the buyer.. no mistake, just me choosing my truck
  fx.1 reveal f_quilt
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_PAST_REGRET.d
  t.any.1 Don't want to sort my regrets for company
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1338.VQ_PAST_REGRET.d2
  t.any.1 May deserves an answer.. not ready to give hers here
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1338.VQ_PAST_SCHOOL
  gate.rule trust>=45 & alone & flag:need_told
  t.any.1 Finished school in eighty.. roofing safety course later.. changed the expiry date on its card in eighty-eight when the boss wouldn't pay for a repeat.. card wasn't valid, whatever I made it say
  fx.1 reveal f_card
  fx.2 set flag:card_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_PAST_SCHOOL.d
  t.any.1 Finished in nineteen-eighty.. practical courses afterward
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1338.VQ_PAST_SCHOOL.d2
  t.any.1 School was easy to leave behind.. course papers less so
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1338.VQ_PAST_TROUBLE
  gate.rule trust>=60 & alone & flag:card_told
  t.any.1 Told the foreman Gwen was gathering a wage complaint in eighty-nine.. she was my friend.. he fired her and made me crew leader.. didn't ask where the promotion came from
  fx.1 reveal f_report
  fx.2 set flag:report_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_PAST_TROUBLE.d
  t.any.1 Plenty on the crew.. not discussing names out loud yet
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1338.VQ_PAST_TROUBLE.d2
  t.any.1 Some work trouble was my doing.. leave it until we're private
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1338.VQ_PAST_WORK
  t.any.1 Roofing since eighty-six.. foreman yelled heels down every time we crossed a slope
  t.any.2 House paint first, then shingles.. paid better up on the roof
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_TALK_AGE
  t.any.1 Thirty-one.. young enough to get every heavy end
  t.any.2 Born in sixty-two.. thirty-one now
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_TALK_DISLIKES
  t.any.1 A man explaining my own ladder to me
  t.any.2 People calling me little lady while handing me the heavy end
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_TALK_FEAR
  t.any.1 The river.. lake water's bad enough when it stays put
  t.any.2 Water moving faster than me.. that's the one I won't argue with
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_TALK_FOOD
  t.any.1 Cornbread with the crisp edge.. middle can go to somebody else
  t.any.2 Peaches cold from a jar.. May always counted the halves
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_TALK_FROM
  t.any.1 Cave City.. not from a cave, before you ask
  t.any.2 Cave City.. room over an old repair shop for a while
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_TALK_HABIT
  t.any.1 Hands keep wanting to check a door twice.. don't start counting for me
  t.any.2 Pick paint from under my thumbnail.. can be nothing there and I'll still do it
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_TALK_HOWARE
  gate.rule !flag:need_told
  t.lo.1 Fine.. don't need a thing
  t.lo.2 Still standing.. save the fuss
  t.mid.1 Getting on.. heels down, keep going
  t.mid.2 Not in a mood for being looked after
  t.mid.3 Still capable of answering for myself. Start there
  t.mid.4 Could use a question that isn't trying to manage me
  t.mid.5 Better now you aren't telling me what I must be feeling
  t.hi.1 Don't believe the fine too hard.. that's all I'm saying
  t.hi.2 Could do without being brave for an audience
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_TALK_HOWARE.a2
  gate.rule trust>=30 & flag:trainees_told & flag:need_told
  t.any.1 Still embarrassed about needing a place.. less tired of saying it now
  t.any.2 No room of my own.. pretending otherwise took more effort than asking
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_TALK_JOKE
  t.any.1 Dad said paint side out like I might put the wall on backward.. charged him an extra dollar for remembering
  t.any.2 Want a roofing joke? Goes over most people's heads.. yes, I know, dreadful
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_TALK_LIKES
  t.any.1 Winning at dominoes without anybody blaming luck
  t.any.2 Clean socks after a roof job.. no grand explanation for it
  t.any.3 Getting a difficult bit right before somebody offers to take it away from me
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_TALK_NAME
  t.any.1 Elise Fugate.. no need to stretch it out
  t.any.2 Fugate.. Elise if you're not collecting names
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_TALK_NERVOUS
  t.any.1 A little.. keep wanting to check where I can get out
  t.any.2 Don't like needing anybody's permission to leave.. makes me fidget
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_TALK_QUIET
  t.any.1 Fine by me.. don't mistake quiet for agreeing
  t.any.2 Can stop talking.. can't promise to stop thinking about the door
  t.any.3 Yes. You don't have to keep me occupied
  t.any.4 Stay if you want. Quiet isn't me sulking at you
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_TALK_STORY
  t.any.1 May once dropped a domino into her cobbler while we played beside the oven.. served it to Amos and waited for him to complain.. double six trouble, she called it, as if he'd ordered the thing
  t.any.2 Family reunion at the lake.. somebody persuaded Dad to try a pedal boat.. he came back claiming the pedals were fitted wrong because his sister did all the work.. none of us let him forget
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_TALK_TV
  t.any.1 First set I saw belonged to the neighbors.. would have watched a blank test pattern
  t.any.2 Liked the game shows.. shouted answers that nobody in the set could hear
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_WORLD_GUARD
  t.any.1 No soldiers that I saw.. nobody directing me
  t.any.2 Haven't met the Guard.. might be elsewhere, wouldn't know
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_WORLD_PLANS
  t.any.1 Dry roof before anything pretty.. find out what this place needs, not what I imagine it has
  t.any.2 Would start with a roof check and a sleeping plan.. we can decide the rest after that
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_WORLD_RADIO
  t.any.1 Haven't heard a broadcast I'd use as instructions yet
  t.any.2 No useful report from me.. still hoping the radio can give one
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.VQ_WORLD_ROAD
  t.any.1 Got along on foot.. wouldn't send a truck from that alone
  t.any.2 Can't certify the route.. turned around where I didn't like the look of it
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1338.leave.angry
  t.any.1 Leaving before I say worse
  t.any.2 This isn't doing either of us good.. I'm going
  tag.1 kind:leave
end

node vp_1338.leave.plain
  t.any.1 Off now.. take care of yourself
  t.any.2 Time to get my feet moving again
  tag.1 kind:leave
end

node vp_1338.react.compliment
  t.any.1 Careful.. might start believing you
  t.any.2 Well.. keep that one, I liked it
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1338.react.gave_blanket
  t.any.1 Thank you.. useful thing to spare
  t.any.2 Glad of this.. won't pretend otherwise
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1338.react.gave_book
  t.any.1 Thanks.. haven't had much to read lately
  t.any.2 Something to occupy my head.. might do me good
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1338.react.gave_clothes
  t.any.1 Thanks.. let's see what fits me
  t.any.2 A change to wear.. appreciate it
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1338.react.gave_food
  t.any.1 Thank you.. appreciate a share
  t.any.2 That's kind.. I'll stop fighting the idea of being helped
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1338.react.gave_water
  t.any.1 Water helps.. thanks for it
  t.any.2 Thank you.. no proud answer for this one
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1338.react.insult
  t.any.1 Watch how you speak to me
  t.any.2 That's enough of that.. I'm not here for it
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1338.react.refused
  t.any.1 Your choice.. mine's what I do next
  t.any.2 No is clear enough.. don't dress it up
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1338.react.sorry
  t.any.1 All right.. we'll see how it goes from here
  t.any.2 Can hear an apology without becoming cheerful straight off
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1338.react.thanks
  t.any.1 Good.. thought that would help
  t.any.2 You're welcome.. don't make it ceremonial
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1338.react.threat
  t.any.1 Back off.. don't make this worse
  t.any.2 Give me room.. want no part of a fight
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1338.return.arrive
  t.any.1 Elise.. mind if I stop a while?
  t.any.2 Back again.. not assuming a place is saved for me
  tag.1 kind:return
end

node vp_1345.VQ_HOUSE_BED
  t.any.1 Yes please.. would like to know whether anyone will still be nearby
  t.any.2 A rest would help.. tell me if there's a time I must get up
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_HOUSE_PHONE
  t.any.1 Would ask about Colin's prison if a call is possible.. don't expect a simple answer
  t.any.2 Somebody at Colin's prison.. might be no way through, but that's whom I'd try
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_HOUSE_QUIET
  t.any.1 Quiet is welcome if I'm not the only person left
  t.any.2 No extra noise for me.. just say if you intend to go away
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_HOUSE_SHELF
  t.any.1 May look for a mystery.. ask before I take one away
  t.any.2 Would like to browse.. won't rearrange your shelves, tempting though it is
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_HOUSE_WELCOME
  t.any.1 Thank you.. not quite ready to call anywhere home
  t.any.2 Would like to stop here a while.. show me where my things won't interfere
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_NOW_HELP
  t.any.1 Can sort written records.. and mend a simple tear if there's thread
  t.any.2 Useful with lists.. tell me what needs recording before I invent a system you hate
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_NOW_HUNGRY
  gate.rule need:hunger>=2
  t.any.1 Yes.. would prefer a little food to another question about it
  t.any.2 Hungry enough to stop pretending reading will distract me
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_NOW_HUNGRY.d
  t.any.1 Not looking for more food just now
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1345.VQ_NOW_HURT
  t.any.1 Please ask before touching.. if you're concerned, we can check
  t.any.2 Not very good at judging myself under stress.. tell me what concerns you
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_NOW_PLAN
  t.any.1 Find reliable word about Colin's prison.. won't travel on a rumor alone
  t.any.2 Somewhere to stop, then an inquiry about Colin.. in that order
  t.any.3 Nothing decided. I dislike uncertainty, but a tidy fiction is worse
  t.any.4 I need a possible next step, not a list of what a sensible woman would do
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_NOW_TIRED
  t.any.1 Not sure when I last slept properly.. knitting a row twice would be an achievement at present
  t.any.2 Haven't a reliable time to give you.. would like to rest within calling distance
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_NOW_TRUST
  t.any.1 Enough to tell you I dislike this question
  t.any.2 Beginning to.. measuring it aloud makes me retreat a little
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_NOW_WANT
  t.any.1 Quiet with somebody nearby.. doesn't require entertaining me
  t.any.2 A place I don't have to keep asking permission to be quiet in
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_NOW_WASH
  t.any.1 Would welcome a wash.. where may I do that?
  t.any.2 Yes.. don't want to put dirty hands near anybody's clean things
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_OFFER_BOOK
  t.any.1 A mystery if there's one available.. otherwise I'll browse
  t.any.2 Gladly.. tell me when you'd like it returned before I begin
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_OFFER_CARDS
  t.any.1 A quiet game would suit.. no need to let me win
  t.any.2 Yes.. reserve the right to be annoyed when I lose
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_OFFER_FOOD
  t.any.1 Yes please.. let me know which is for sharing
  t.any.2 Would appreciate some.. if it's packaged I can read the label myself, print side up if possible
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_OFFER_SOAP
  t.any.1 Would appreciate that.. where should I wash?
  t.any.2 Yes.. will leave the washing space as I find it if I can
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_PAST_CHURCH
  t.any.1 Went to a church hall when this began.. wanted people nearby, not a sermon
  t.any.2 Not much of a churchgoer.. the hall had company that first day
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_PAST_DAYONE
  t.any.1 Went to the church hall.. didn't want to hear my own footsteps alone
  t.any.2 Took my notebook, then went looking for a room with other people in it
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_PAST_FAMILY
  t.any.1 My son Colin was in prison when I last had reliable news.. don't know what's happening there now
  t.any.2 Brother Ellis somewhere out of touch.. Colin imprisoned.. no reunion arranged for me
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_PAST_FIRSTJOB
  t.any.1 Library assistant in sixty-seven.. labels first, desk later
  t.any.2 First pay was library work at nineteen.. learned people's names before their reading tastes
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_PAST_HOBBY
  t.any.1 Knitting.. can make a cuff if you allow it a little character
  t.any.2 Read mysteries off duty.. not every book passing the desk
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_PAST_HOUSE
  t.any.1 Upstairs flat.. enough stair climbing to discourage casual callers
  t.any.2 Small flat.. kept cans under the bed because the kitchen had no storage
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_PAST_LOST
  gate.rule trust>=35 & flag:alias_told
  t.any.1 Lost the right to call a visit welcome.. questioned Colin's prison work supervisor in ninety-two.. Colin asked me to stop coming.. still sent requests, and he refused them
  fx.1 reveal f_visits
  fx.2 set flag:visits_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_PAST_LOST.d
  t.any.1 Some people are alive and still out of reach
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1345.VQ_PAST_LOST.d2
  t.any.1 Colin's a difficult subject.. leave me some room
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1345.VQ_PAST_LOVE
  t.any.1 Married Dennis in sixty-nine.. he left five years later
  t.any.2 Dennis could be charming to a room.. difficult to share one with
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_PAST_MONEY
  gate.rule trust>=38 & alone & flag:visits_told
  t.any.1 Inheritance, if you insist.. forged Ellis's acknowledgment of Father's will in eighty-seven.. estate closed before he could contest my share of the house money.. he never signed that paper
  fx.1 reveal f_will
  fx.2 set flag:will_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_PAST_MONEY.d
  t.any.1 Won't discuss the inheritance in company
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1345.VQ_PAST_MONEY.d2
  t.any.1 Not ready to open the estate account for you
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1345.VQ_PAST_REGRET
  gate.rule trust>=72 & alone & flag:books_told
  t.any.1 Colin wrote in eighty-nine admitting a barn fire.. a neighbor was under suspicion.. burned the letter instead of clearing that man.. Colin went to prison for a different fire later.. never told anyone about the first
  fx.1 reveal f_letter
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_PAST_REGRET.d
  t.any.1 There is an answer.. won't spend it on a room full of ears
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1345.VQ_PAST_REGRET.d2
  t.any.1 Don't want a comforting guess about what I regret
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1345.VQ_PAST_SON
  gate.rule trust>=10
  t.any.1 Colin, born in seventy.. in prison since ninety-one.. visited him as Mrs Vale so nobody would connect his name to mine at the library
  fx.1 reveal f_alias
  fx.2 set flag:alias_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_PAST_SON.d
  t.any.1 Colin's twenty-three.. in prison when I last knew
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1345.VQ_PAST_TROUBLE
  gate.rule trust>=55 & alone & flag:will_told
  t.any.1 Thirty donated local-history books.. marked them water-damaged in ninety, sold them privately for Colin's solicitor.. kept the proceeds off library accounts.. none of those books was wet
  fx.1 reveal f_books
  fx.2 set flag:books_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_PAST_TROUBLE.d
  t.any.1 Yes, trouble.. not a story for passing around
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1345.VQ_PAST_TROUBLE.d2
  t.any.1 Ask privately when I'm ready to say more than yes
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1345.VQ_PAST_WORK
  t.any.1 Library desk and withdrawal lists.. Alma did most of the repairs
  t.any.2 Circulation work.. the blue tray was returns, never a place for unfinished lunch
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_TALK_AGE
  t.any.1 Forty-five.. not taking nominations for another age
  t.any.2 Born in forty-eight.. forty-five now
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_TALK_DISLIKES
  t.any.1 Being asked whether I've read every book.. have you eaten every potato?
  t.any.2 People deciding a quiet woman has nothing to say
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_TALK_FEAR
  t.any.1 Being the only person in a building.. quiet isn't the same thing
  t.any.2 Alone after everyone has gone.. always listened for the last pair of shoes
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_TALK_FOOD
  t.any.1 Potato soup with plenty of pepper.. not thick enough to stand a spoon in
  t.any.2 Pears.. fresh ones, when there were fresh ones to choose
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_TALK_FROM
  t.any.1 Elizabethtown.. upstairs flat, rather fewer rooms than stairs
  t.any.2 From Elizabethtown.. spent most working days behind the library desk
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_TALK_HABIT
  t.any.1 Read labels twice.. print side up, then turn it to find the date
  t.any.2 Keep straightening my knitting.. there isn't a straight row to preserve
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_TALK_HOWARE
  t.lo.1 Not ready for a crowd.. one quiet corner would do
  t.lo.2 Still deciding whether talking is helping
  t.mid.1 Less agreeable than I look.. please allow for that
  t.mid.2 Would like company that doesn't require a performance
  t.mid.3 There is a polite answer. I suspect neither of us needs it
  t.mid.4 I'd rather not turn the whole thing into a summary for you
  t.mid.5 Better with a question I can answer badly and leave alone
  t.hi.1 Angry, mostly.. not asking you to improve it
  t.hi.2 Could sit near somebody and say absolutely nothing
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_TALK_JOKE
  t.any.1 A man returned a book saying it had no ending.. he'd used the final page for his shopping.. wanted to know whether that counted as a renewal
  t.any.2 My knitting has a right side.. finding it is the entertaining part
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_TALK_LIKES
  t.any.1 A mystery that gives you a fair chance.. unfair ones annoy me more than they should
  t.any.2 Knitting with someone else's conversation going on nearby
  t.any.3 Someone returning a book because they finished it, not because they feel guilty
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_TALK_LUCK
  t.any.1 Believe in luck.. object to people treating it as something they earned
  t.any.2 Have a lucky knitting needle.. identical to the other, which complicates things
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_TALK_NAME
  t.any.1 Bonnie Yates.. yes, that's my name
  t.any.2 Bonnie.. surname Yates if it's needed
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_TALK_NERVOUS
  t.any.1 Yes.. shouldn't have to provide a more decorative explanation
  t.any.2 Listening for people leaving.. not trying to overhear you
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_TALK_QUIET
  t.any.1 Want quiet with somebody still nearby.. not an empty house
  t.any.2 One quiet corner.. doesn't have to come with a conversation
  t.any.3 Yes. We needn't mistake silence for a failure of conversation
  t.any.4 Stay if you wish. I can enjoy company without making a recommendation
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_TALK_STORY
  t.any.1 Alma put a sign on the blue tray saying returns.. a boy returned a library pencil, a button and an apology for the button.. she'd only meant books, but kept the apology
  t.any.2 Colin knitted three stitches when he was nine.. announced he'd finished a scarf for a very thin man.. kept wearing it on one finger until Dennis sent a proper present
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_WORLD_GUARD
  t.any.1 Haven't seen soldiers.. have no direct account to add
  t.any.2 No Guard sighting from me.. don't turn that into evidence they're absent everywhere
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_WORLD_LAW
  t.any.1 Haven't seen the sheriff.. would like an actual answer about the prison
  t.any.2 Can't tell you who's enforcing what.. my son's behind a wall I can't ask through
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_WORLD_MONEY
  t.any.1 A dollar's worth depends on someone accepting it.. wouldn't discard it yet
  t.any.2 People might trade food for work.. ought to ask what they actually want
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.VQ_WORLD_SUPPLIES
  t.any.1 Don't know which stores have food.. kept tins at home, but that isn't a report on what's there now
  t.any.2 Can't name a stocked shop.. lists from before this would mislead us
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1345.leave.angry
  t.any.1 Prefer to leave while I can still speak plainly
  t.any.2 Nothing to gain by staying angry in this room.. goodbye
  tag.1 kind:leave
end

node vp_1345.leave.plain
  t.any.1 Going now.. hope the quiet treats you well
  t.any.2 Had better move along.. look after yourself
  tag.1 kind:leave
end

node vp_1345.react.compliment
  t.any.1 How unexpected.. thank you
  t.any.2 May choose to believe that for a while
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1345.react.gave_blanket
  t.any.1 Thank you.. glad to have a blanket
  t.any.2 That's welcome.. will try to keep it clean
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1345.react.gave_book
  t.any.1 A book.. thank you, pleased to have it
  t.any.2 Thank you.. glad of something with pages to turn
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1345.react.gave_clothes
  t.any.1 Thank you.. will find out whether these fit
  t.any.2 Useful to have another change.. appreciate it
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1345.react.gave_food
  t.any.1 Thank you.. a welcome share
  t.any.2 Appreciate the food.. not taking it lightly
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1345.react.gave_water
  t.any.1 Thank you.. water is very welcome
  t.any.2 Appreciate having something to drink
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1345.react.insult
  t.any.1 No.. you don't get another attempt at that
  t.any.2 Can hear you perfectly.. wish I couldn't just then
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1345.react.refused
  t.any.1 Understood.. would have preferred otherwise
  t.any.2 Very well.. won't pretend I didn't want a yes
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1345.react.sorry
  t.any.1 Thank you for saying it.. still need a moment
  t.any.2 An apology is a start.. let's leave space after it
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1345.react.thanks
  t.any.1 Glad it was some use.. no further ceremony needed
  t.any.2 You're welcome.. should have said so sooner
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1345.react.threat
  t.any.1 Stay away from me.. don't want this
  t.any.2 Please give me space.. there's nothing useful in frightening me
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1345.return.arrive
  t.any.1 Bonnie again.. would a short visit be all right?
  t.any.2 Came back.. don't mean to impose my company
  tag.1 kind:return
end

node vp_1349.VQ_HOUSE_BED
  t.any.1 Yes.. could lie down without needing a story told over me
  t.any.2 Would appreciate the rest.. let me know when the space is needed
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_HOUSE_CHORES
  t.any.1 Give me something small to start.. thumbs together won't get your chores done
  t.any.2 Can wash up if there's washing to do.. where would you like me to begin?
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_HOUSE_RADIO
  t.any.1 Try it.. might hear something that isn't my own running commentary
  t.any.2 Would listen.. don't need to put music on just because of my old job
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_HOUSE_STAIRS
  t.any.1 Up is better than down.. may look if there's no objection
  t.any.2 Could take a look upstairs.. tell me what's private first
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_HOUSE_WELCOME
  t.any.1 Thanks.. I'll resist reviewing the place like a bar
  t.any.2 Would like to stop.. tell me where I won't be in the way
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_NOW_CARRYING
  t.any.1 Coins, pencil, a scrap of music.. no instrument hiding under the jacket
  t.any.2 A few old coins.. dates interested me more than what they'd buy
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_NOW_COLD
  t.any.1 Cold.. hands are being particularly dramatic about it
  t.any.2 Yes.. another layer wouldn't go to waste
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_NOW_HELP
  t.any.1 Can wash up or mend a simple loose fitting.. piano's less useful unless you happen to need one played
  t.any.2 Could sort things, carry a fair share.. ask before assigning the whole building
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_NOW_HUNGRY
  gate.rule need:hunger>=2
  t.any.1 Yes.. could stop talking and get on with eating
  t.any.2 Hungry.. not inventing a funny way to say it
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_NOW_HUNGRY.d
  t.any.1 Don't need another share right now.. ask someone hungrier
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1349.VQ_NOW_HURT
  t.any.1 Need a look rather than a brave guess? Ask before you touch
  t.any.2 Hard to separate old aches from everything else.. can check what worries you
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_NOW_PLAN
  t.any.1 Find somewhere that wants help.. try for news of Arlen after that
  t.any.2 No grand plan.. work for a place to stop and think
  t.any.3 Need to choose my next bit. No accompaniment will make the choice for me
  t.any.4 Haven't decided. I'd like to leave one thing without a clever ending
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_NOW_TIRED
  t.any.1 Couldn't date the last sleep.. tired enough to miss a chord with both hands
  t.any.2 Don't have a useful hour to name.. could lie down instead of looking capable
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_NOW_WANT
  t.any.1 Work.. a small job I can finish before I think too much
  t.any.2 Want something useful to do.. doesn't have to come with applause
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_OFFER_BLANKET
  t.any.1 Would be useful.. yes please
  t.any.2 I'll accept.. no grand refusal to improve the story
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_OFFER_CARDS
  t.any.1 Deal me in if we're not betting.. coins stay in the purse
  t.any.2 Could play.. don't mistake a grin for a good hand
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_OFFER_FOOD
  t.any.1 Yes.. could do a little work for my share
  t.any.2 Would take some.. no joke about starving artists, please
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_OFFER_WORK
  t.any.1 Good.. what's the work, and what's a fair amount?
  t.any.2 Yes.. prefer a job to sitting here earning my own bad review
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_PAST_DAYONE
  gate.rule trust>=20
  t.any.1 Stranger lying on the road beside a cellar stair.. asked me for help, gave him my first name.. then ran without fetching anyone.. never learned what became of him
  fx.1 reveal f_cellar
  fx.2 set flag:cellar_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_PAST_DAYONE.d
  t.any.1 Left town frightened.. not ready to unfold the whole day
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1349.VQ_PAST_DAYONE.d2
  t.any.1 Bad start.. would rather say it when I can finish
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1349.VQ_PAST_FAMILY
  t.any.1 Brother Arlen.. last knew him in Pikeville, not where he is now
  t.any.2 Dad died last year.. Arlen's the one I'd try to find
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_PAST_FIRSTJOB
  t.any.1 First paid bar set in seventy-four.. nineteen, with a borrowed good blouse
  t.any.2 Bar piano at nineteen.. nobody told me tips could include advice instead of coins
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_PAST_HARDEST
  gate.rule trust>=46 & alone & flag:tunes_told
  t.any.1 Being laughed at during my own solo set in eighty-one.. heckler went after my voice and I ran offstage, never went back to that place.. so much for claiming I never ran
  fx.1 reveal f_ran
  fx.2 set flag:ran_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_PAST_HARDEST.d
  t.any.1 Hardest isn't necessarily the story you'd expect
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1349.VQ_PAST_HARDEST.d2
  t.any.1 Not with an audience.. had enough of those
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1349.VQ_PAST_HIDING
  gate.rule trust>=78 & alone & flag:cards_told
  t.any.1 Arlen hit a pedestrian in eighty-nine and drove away.. he told me, I washed the blood off his car.. didn't report him or find out whether that person lived.. protected my brother by not asking
  fx.1 reveal f_car
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_PAST_HIDING.d
  t.any.1 Yes.. being willing to admit that isn't the same as being ready to tell it
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1349.VQ_PAST_HIDING.d2
  t.any.1 Not something I can throw into general conversation
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1349.VQ_PAST_HOBBY
  t.any.1 Cards.. collect odd coins too, dates more than value
  t.any.2 Keep coins with worn faces.. and lose card games with a very clear expression
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_PAST_HOUSE
  t.any.1 Rented back room.. piano stool counted as a luxury
  t.any.2 Mabel's back room.. one window, weekly rent, no band rehearsals
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_PAST_PARENTS
  t.any.1 Roy, my dad, died in ninety-two.. Mother was in Pikeville when I last heard
  t.any.2 Dad's dead.. no current word of Mother.. she endured two pianists in one house for years
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_PAST_PROUD
  t.any.1 Paid my own rent for years.. piano money and whatever else earned it
  t.any.2 Accompanied a singer through a whole set after his music fell behind the piano.. knew enough by ear to keep him going
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_PAST_TRAVEL
  t.any.1 Lexington was farthest.. little bar engagement, nothing grand
  t.any.2 Played out toward Lexington once.. mostly stayed round Pikeville
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_PAST_TROUBLE
  gate.rule trust>=61 & alone & flag:ran_told
  t.any.1 Used marked cards at a church benefit in seventy-nine.. took the pot meant to fix a widow's furnace and kept it.. wasn't a harmless game, whatever I called it
  fx.1 reveal f_cards
  fx.2 set flag:cards_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_PAST_TROUBLE.d
  t.any.1 Made some trouble myself.. names and details can wait
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1349.VQ_PAST_TROUBLE.d2
  t.any.1 Would rather tell it privately or not yet
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1349.VQ_PAST_WORK
  t.any.1 Bar piano.. accompaniment, mostly.. piano money paid the room
  t.any.2 Played behind singers and did solo sets when rent made the decision
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_PERSON_A_PROMISE
  gate.rule flag:arianne_intro & !flag:arianne_promise_done
  t.any.1 Something in my head.. Just told me.. Do you know anything about "A promise"?
  beat.any.1 5000|I'm here. Love. I'm here. I always was here. Don't you understand? You're trapped. In this game..
  beat.any.2 7000|I missed you... So much. I always did... Soon the code of this game will cut me off once again..
  beat.any.3 7000|You'll always be my little sunshine. ----#$!$@!K@#!@L#!M<@%O!#@^?Z
  beat.any.4 5000|Sorry.. what did you ask me? I lost my place..
  fx.1 set flag:arianne_promise_done
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_TALK_AGE
  t.any.1 Thirty-eight.. piano fingers age separately, apparently
  t.any.2 Born in fifty-five.. thirty-eight and still losing room keys
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_TALK_DISLIKES
  t.any.1 Play something happy.. always said by somebody already enjoying themselves
  t.any.2 Being called the girl on piano.. even when I was thirty-seven
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_TALK_FEAR
  gate.rule !flag:cellar_told
  t.any.1 Basements.. never ran from a thing though, that's my line
  t.any.2 Don't like going below ground.. never ran from anything, mind you
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_TALK_FEAR.a2
  gate.rule flag:cellar_told
  t.any.1 Basements.. prefer a room with a way out I can see
  t.any.2 Going down into a cellar.. not volunteering for that
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_TALK_FOOD
  t.any.1 Egg sandwich after a late set.. nobody gets artistic with it
  t.any.2 Pickles.. no, that isn't an invitation to put them in everything
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_TALK_FROM
  t.any.1 Pikeville.. rented a room, never owned the view
  t.any.2 From Pikeville.. knew the back entrances of more bars than was useful
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_TALK_HABIT
  t.any.1 Thumbs together.. pressing till I notice I'm doing it
  t.any.2 Hands can't find a keyboard, so the thumbs get each other
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_TALK_HOWARE
  t.lo.1 Available for light work and poor decisions.. prefer the work
  t.lo.2 Not my best engagement.. no encore required
  t.mid.1 Trying to quit making a joke before every answer
  t.mid.2 Could stand being ordinary company for a bit
  t.mid.3 Could give you an amusing answer. I'm trying the other kind
  t.mid.4 Not every silence is a dramatic pause, despite my reputation
  t.mid.5 Better when I don't have to earn the company with a joke
  t.hi.1 Bad mood.. don't need it turned into an amusing one
  t.hi.2 Want a task with an end I can recognize
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_TALK_JOKE
  t.any.1 Played a bar with no piano once.. owner wanted a discount, like I'd brought the wrong hands
  t.any.2 My father saved the bent quarter to teach me thrift.. could have bought a better lesson for a dime
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_TALK_LIKES
  t.any.1 Cards without money on the table.. can enjoy losing then, in theory
  t.any.2 A singer who knows when to let the piano finish
  t.any.3 A singer forgetting the audience for half a verse. You can hear the difference
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_TALK_LUCK
  t.any.1 Keep the bent quarter for luck.. was bent before I got it, so it can't blame me
  t.any.2 Believe in luck more readily when it belongs to somebody else
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_TALK_MUSIC
  gate.rule trust>=32 & flag:cellar_told
  t.any.1 Piano.. wrote the arrangements Otis put his name on from eighty-four through eighty-seven.. took anonymous pay because I was scared of a flop with Arianne printed on it
  fx.1 reveal f_tunes
  fx.2 set flag:tunes_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_TALK_MUSIC.d
  t.any.1 Piano mostly.. liked accompanying more than singing
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1349.VQ_TALK_MUSIC.d2
  t.any.1 Some music is easier to play than to talk about
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1349.VQ_TALK_NAME
  t.any.1 Arianne Y. Just Arianne is fine
  t.any.2 Arianne.. the Y can stay on the old posters
  fx.1 set flag:arianne_intro
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_TALK_QUIET
  t.any.1 Can manage quiet.. doesn't need a piano underneath
  t.any.2 Let's leave it quiet.. haven't got a good line ready anyway
  t.any.3 Yes. I promise not to review the silence afterward
  t.any.4 Stay if you like. I can let you hear me not being entertaining
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_TALK_STORY
  t.any.1 Mabel thought my piano stool was a hat stand.. came home from a set and found three hats balanced on it.. she said it was the first time that piece of furniture had earned its space
  t.any.2 Father made me play for a wedding where the groom forgot the ring.. repeated the introduction until a cousin came back with his own.. afterward Dad said he charged by the minute and ought to thank them
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_WORLD_CAUSE
  t.any.1 Don't know.. luck's a belief of mine, not an explanation for this
  t.any.2 Could blame half the world.. wouldn't make it knowledge
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_WORLD_GUARD
  t.any.1 Haven't seen the Guard.. no useful sighting from me
  t.any.2 No soldiers that I can report seeing.. won't make a rumor wear a uniform
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_WORLD_MONEY
  t.any.1 Keep the old coins regardless.. for spending, ask the person selling
  t.any.2 A fair job might buy more than a coin now.. won't assume everyone agrees
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.VQ_WORLD_ROAD
  t.any.1 Passed on foot.. doesn't make the road fit for everything else
  t.any.2 Only know where I got through.. can't tell you what's changed behind me
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1349.leave.angry
  t.any.1 Leaving.. too angry to make this useful
  t.any.2 Had enough.. don't need a clever exit line
  tag.1 kind:leave
end

node vp_1349.leave.plain
  t.any.1 Time I moved on.. keep yourself in one piece
  t.any.2 Going.. no farewell solo, you'll be pleased to hear
  tag.1 kind:leave
end

node vp_1349.react.compliment
  t.any.1 Might improve the opinion I have of myself.. thanks
  t.any.2 Well.. that's nicer than my version
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1349.react.gave_blanket
  t.any.1 Thank you.. useful without being glamorous
  t.any.2 Appreciate having this.. thank you
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1349.react.gave_book
  t.any.1 Thank you.. gives my head something else to do
  t.any.2 A book.. glad you thought of that
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1349.react.gave_clothes
  t.any.1 Thanks.. will see how these suit me
  t.any.2 Something else to wear.. grateful for the choice
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1349.react.gave_food
  t.any.1 Thanks.. glad of the food
  t.any.2 Appreciate it.. an easy thing to say honestly
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1349.react.gave_water
  t.any.1 Thank you.. good to have water
  t.any.2 That's welcome.. truly
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1349.react.insult
  t.any.1 Can insult myself without your help
  t.any.2 Okay.. that wasn't funny, just mean
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1349.react.refused
  t.any.1 Okay.. wish it was different, but okay
  t.any.2 No then.. can take an answer without a performance
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1349.react.sorry
  t.any.1 Okay.. can leave that standing for now
  t.any.2 Heard it.. don't know my answer yet
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1349.react.thanks
  t.any.1 Good.. managed something without accompaniment
  t.any.2 You're welcome.. no encore for that one
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1349.react.threat
  t.any.1 Give me room.. don't want a fight
  t.any.2 Stop.. not playing along with that
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1349.return.arrive
  t.any.1 Arianne.. back for a little company if it's welcome
  t.any.2 Came round again.. haven't brought a piano with me
  tag.1 kind:return
end
